              "detail_id": "8fc2f8ba-b5f0-4d39-9a18-c6d2e0c81201",
              "text": "逐箱點件，並核對品項、數量、外包裝與送貨單。"
            },
            {
              "detail_id": "8a85002a-2d7f-4afa-97f9-500d52c7f7ce",
